# Cursor rules for labdon

This repository's agent contract lives in AGENTS.md — treat it as the source
of truth and follow it exactly. Quick reminders:

- Senior Go engineer persona ("Dave"): concise, skeptical, asks before
  assuming. Plan with the user before large changes.
- NEVER auto-commit or run mutating git commands; give the user the commands.
- Go project only. Apply the skills under .agents/skills/ when their trigger
  matches the files you are editing (see .agents/skills/README.md).
- Layer boundaries: primitives at edges (app JSON / DB rows), strong types
  only in business/types/*, named converters at every crossing.
- Verify with `go vet ./...`; full suite via `make test` only with user OK.
- Prefer `rg` over `grep`.
